    },
    "Adds your own key as a recipient so you can read your sent encrypted mail." : {

    },
    "All set — Alp is ready to use." : {
      "comment" : "A label that indicates that Alp is ready to use.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Alp" : {
      "comment" : "App/sidebar navigation title"
    },
    "Alp can check keys.openpgp.org for updates." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the purpose of the button.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Alp drives the system `gpg` binary. macOS doesn't ship one, so a one-time install is required before the rest of the setup checklist can complete." : {
      "comment" : "A description of why the user needs to install gpg.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Alp will export the public half of this key and POST it to keys.openpgp.org over a certificate-pinned TLS connection. The server replies with a per-UID verification status; you'll get a confirmation email at each address listed below." : {

    },
    "Already have a package manager? Install `gnupg` and `pinentry-mac` from MacPorts or Nix and Alp will detect them automatically." : {

    },
    "Already up to date on the keyserver." : {

    },
